PURPOSE of /kernel/ipmi/hotmod
Description: Tests hot add/remove of IPMI interfaces
Author: Rachel Sibley <rasibley@redhat.com>

Description:
This test came about because of a regression Fujitsu ran into with RHEL 6.6. 
They were one of the vendors that were upset by static linking of ipmi and
they need to be able to hot mod ipmi because of their hardware partitioning 
capabilities. Now that ipmi is dynamically linked again, they expect 
that the pre-6.4 ability to hot mod ipmi should work.

PASS on hot add/remove of IPMI interfaces without kernel panic
